<title>CANADA: Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - Aug 8.</title>
<headline>Canadian Gas Assoc storage survey - Aug 8.</headline>
<dateline>CALGARY 1997-08-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Canadian Gas Association (CGA) weekly survey of Canadian natural gas in storage in billion cubic feet (bcf) for the week ended August 8:</p>
<p>							 Pct Full  Pct Full</p>
<p>		 08/08/97  08/01/97  Pct Full  Week Ago  Year Ago</p>
<p>East	    130.47    120.30     56.1	51.7	58.5</p>
<p>West	    165.35    157.26     63.1	60.0	67.8</p>
<p>Total Canada  295.82    277.56     59.8	56.1	63.6</p>
<p>East-West division is the Manitoba/Saskatchewan and North Dakota/Minnesota borders.</p>
<p>East capacity 08/08/97: 232.55 bcf, 08/01/97: 232.55 bcf.</p>
</text>
